Ayo.

282
00:22:37,390 --> 00:22:38,260
Minumlah sup.

283
00:22:38,500 --> 00:22:39,820
Aku lihat kau datang
dengan terburu-buru,

284
00:22:39,820 --> 00:22:40,870
