Atas dasar apa kau mengaturku?

305
00:26:15,390 --> 00:26:16,230
Dasar gila.

306
00:26:16,430 --> 00:26:19,500
- Aku temanmu. Minumlah air.
- Tidak mau. Pergi sana.

307
00:26:20,430 --> 00:26:21,270
Bukan, kau…

308
00:26:21,910 --> 00:26:24,780
Jangan banyak tingkah
karena aku menyukaimu.

309
00:26:25,060 --> 00:26:26,390
Banyak tingkah apanya?

310
00:26:27,060 --> 00:26:28,780
Terserah kau mau menyukai siapa.

311
00:26:29,190 --> 00:26:31,820
- Sajikan anggur! Cepat!
- Tidak, Pelayan. Jangan.

312
00:26:31,820 --> 00:26:32,820
Kami mau bayar.

313
00:26:33,430 --> 00:26:36,430
Jangan minum lagi, sungguh.
Patuhlah, benar-benar tidak boleh minum.

314
00:26:36,630 --> 00:26:39,390
- Halo, ada yang bisa saya bantu?
- Sajikan anggur!

315
00:26:39,390 --> 00:26:41,510
Jangan dengarkan dia. Kami mau bayar.
Berapa harganya?

316
00:26:43,740 --> 00:26:44,580
Berapa harganya?

317
00:26:45,190 --> 00:26:47,020
Pak, totalnya 2.100 yuan.

318
00:26:48,910 --> 00:26:49,750
Berapa?

319
00:26:49,910 --> 00:26:50,750
Totalnya 2.100 yuan.

320
00:26:51,910 --> 00:26:53,910
Kalau tidak, catat dalam tagihan
Kak Zhao saja.

321
00:26:55,910 --> 00:26:56,820
Catat dalam tagihan.

322
00:26:57,780 --> 00:26:58,620
Terima kasih.

323
00:27:01,910 --> 00:27:03,150
Ayo pergi.

324
00:27:03,150 --> 00:27:03,990
Sudah mau tutup.

325
00:27:05,740 --> 00:27:07,670
Harga minumanmu setara gajiku
selama setengah bulan lebih.

326
00:27:07,670 --> 00:27:08,820
Astaga.

327
00:27:09,540 --> 00:27:11,190
Ayo, kita pergi menyanyi.

328
00:27:11,190 --> 00:27:12,740
Menyanyi apanya?
Sekarang sudah larut malam.

329
00:27:12,740 --> 00:27:13,630
Ayo pulang.

330
00:27:13,820 --> 00:27:15,990
Bukan, aku harus menunjukkan nyanyianku,

331
00:27:16,260 --> 00:27:19,470
