372
00:31:49,710 --> 00:31:50,550
Kau minum alkohol?

373
00:31:51,580 --> 00:31:52,420
Iya.

374
00:31:52,540 --> 00:31:54,710
Di mana aku dibutuhkan,
aku akan muncul di sana.

375
